            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-763] findbugs fails to run on jenkins</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-763</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Search for &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;ERROR&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/bookkeeper-trunk-precommit-build/641/consoleText&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/bookkeeper-trunk-precommit-build/641/consoleText&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

