                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14012368" author="ikelly" created="Thu, 29 May 2014 13:49:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Patch makes the compile phase install the packages rather than just build them. I&apos;ve tested locally, and it catches the findbugs issues in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-758&quot; title=&quot;Add TryReadLastAddConfirmed API&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;BOOKKEEPER-758&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;BOOKKEEPER-758&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. It also highlights some issues with javadoc, which weren&apos;t being surfaced for the same reason.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14013141" author="hustlmsp" created="Fri, 30 May 2014 00:28:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;+1 for the patch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
